    "created_at": "2026-02-09T15:07:23Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-02-09T15:07:23Z",
    "body": "Actually, the spec doesn't explicitly define arrow‑key navigation behavior, leaving that to user agents.\nSo tabindex=\"-1\" doesn’t take on any special meaning here beyond its standard definition.",
